==Trivia==
*Like [[Moneko (Special Cat)|Moneko]], she has a unique death animation; her ghost also appears to be [[Crazed Cats (origin)|Crazed]].
*Crazed Moneko was the first unit to have an ability that activates only on one part of a multi-hit attack.
*Unlike other Crazed Cats, Crazed Moneko's evolution is named differently to her original form, being Corrupted Moneko rather than Crazed Miss Moneko.
**However, this is not the case in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]], where Miss Moneko is named Star Moneko and Corrupted Moneko is Crazed Star Moneko.
*Crazed Moneko is the only Crazed Cat Unit who retains the purple smoke from their [[Crazed Moneko (Enemy)|enemy form]].

